    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly is delighted to present this exceptional, top floor, three bedroom, dual aspect apartment with great views of the River Liffey and Docklands which can be enjoyed from a generous top floor terrace. The property is bright and spacious and benefits from two large terraces and access to a landscaped garden courtyard within the building. The stylishly presented interior briefly comprises entrance hall with a generous utility room, open plan living space with access to the terrace, three bedrooms, en-suite and a bathroom.  Must be viewed to be appreciated!\r\n\r\nMore about this location...\r\n\r\nForbes Quay is situated just off Sir John Rogerson's Quay at Grand Canal Dock, on the same street as the iconic Marker Hotel in Grand Canal Square which neighbours the Bord Gáis Energy Theatre. A host of fashionable bars, cafes, restaurants and convenience stores are on the doorstep. Grand Canal Dock is home to many leading multinational companies such as Google, JP Morgan, Tik Tok and State Street. Other landmarks within walking distance include the Aviva Stadium, the 3 Arena and The Convention Centre Dublin, while the IFSC, Trinity College, Grafton Street and Merrion Square are all less than a twenty minute walk away. The Grand Canal DART station and the Spencer Dock LUAS stop also provide convenient transport options."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime location in the heart of Grand Canal Dock.\r\nStunning views.\r\nStylishly furnished.\r\nDual aspect living space.\r\nGenerous, covered terrace.\r\nSpacious open plan living/dining area.\r\nExcellent storage space.\r\nAmazing local amenities.\r\nWell managed development."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B3"
      }
    ],
